cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata and the earlier paper listed under references."
type: software
title: "Gold price forecasting under regime change"
authors:
  - family-names: "Elbushra"
    given-names: "Mohamed"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Derdiry/gold-price-regime-change"
abstract: >-
  Re-evaluation and extension of Wan & Elbushra (ICCNC 2024): deep forecasters (LSTM, GRU,
  a hybrid TSMixer, PatchTST, TFT), validation-selected ensembles and zero-shot Chronos against
  persistence for Sudanese and international gold prices, with Diebold–Mariano tests and
  preregistered follow-up experiments.
keywords:
  - time-series-forecasting
  - regime-change
  - distribution-shift
  - gold-price
  - diebold-mariano
references:
